|CKBGarou|000

|CK0Garou are shapechanging defenders of Gaea who fight through physical power,
spiritual gifts, and three distinct forms: human, crinos, and wolf. Each form
changes equipment access, communication, defenses, and available techniques.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Human form handles ordinary equipment and spiritual work, crinos blends
weapons with natural strength, and wolf form gives up equipment for the
guild's strongest natural combat. Garou also dedicate themselves toward
Warrior, Guardian, or Shaman priorities and must respect Gaea's equipment and
behavioral restrictions.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0transform changes form, enrage builds violence, fclaw and fbite use natural
weapons, howl and scent coordinate the hunt, eat restores a wolf from a corpse,
and sanctify, summon, and other spiritual gifts support Gaea's cause.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Garou if you want form management, aggressive natural combat,
self-recovery, and a strong nature-bound identity with meaningful equipment
tradeoffs.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBghelp basics|CK0, |CKBghelp dedication|CK0, and
|CKBghelp equipment|CK0 for the full guide.|000

